WEBVTT

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:13.467
Sol: I’ll let the learned policy start, then check each grasp and bin placement from the camera views.

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:24.500
Sol: The policy has gripped the gray shoes and started lifting them. I’m checking that they stay held during the transfer.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:34.967
Sol: The shoes are still on the table, and the policy is struggling around their openings. I’ll take over when the controller hands back the arm.

00:00:34.967 --> 00:00:49.867
Sol: I’ve lifted clear of the shoes. I’m lining up a grasp across one shoe’s side so the pads can hold it securely.

00:00:49.867 --> 00:01:05.233
Sol: The shoes are now visibly off the table and held securely. I’ll carry them above the bin rim before releasing them.

00:01:05.233 --> 00:01:18.333
Sol: One shoe is in the bin; the other remains on the table. The policy is now approaching the red pen.

00:01:18.333 --> 00:01:30.300
Sol: The pen and yellow tape roll have both landed in the bin. The remaining shoe and blue screwdriver are still on the table.

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:43.067
Sol: The screwdriver is in the bin. Only the second shoe remains; the policy’s latest grasp did not lift it.

00:01:43.067 --> 00:01:52.567
Sol: The second shoe has landed in the bin. I’m checking the final scene and letting the arm withdraw so it touches none of the objects.

00:01:52.567 --> 00:01:56.800
Sol: All objects are in the plastic bin, and the arm is clear of them.
